diff --git a/.changeset/age-restriction-dashboard.md b/.changeset/age-restriction-dashboard.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..47e755a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/age-restriction-dashboard.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Add age restriction controls. Products can be marked as age-restricted on the product page. Site settings get a minimum age and a store time zone for age checks. The customer page shows whether a customer is eligible for age-restricted products and lets a superuser set their date of birth. The product list marks age-restricted products with an "Age restricted" label next to the name; the products stay in the list. These controls appear only when the API supports them.
