@@ -18,6 +18,14 @@ For detailed change history, use git history and PRs instead of expanding this f
 
 - [Brief changes with keywords and references]
 
+### Age restriction (dashboard): done, 2026-10-23
+
+- Requires the core age-restriction API (`isAgeRestricted`, `ageRestrictionMinimumAge`, `timeZone`, `User.birthday`, `User.isAgeEligible`, `User.isSuperuser`). Main schema only; staging builds hide the controls via `isMainSchema()`.
+- Product page: age-restricted toggle. Site settings: "Age restriction" section (minimum age, store time zone). Customer page: `CustomerAgeCard` (eligibility flag, superuser-only date of birth).
+- Fragments carry the new fields with `@lockSchema(schema: "main")` on the new selections only. Mock objects typed as those fragments gained the required keys (S12-D1).
+- Known limitations: the age section has no settings hash anchor, so settings search does not link to it (X-15). Birthday `INVALID` uses card copy; the shared `utils/errors/account.ts` mapper is unchanged (X-14).
+- Changeset: patch. Message ids: 15 added to `locale/defaultMessages.json`.
+
 ### Rosetta workspace documentation: done, 2026-10-21
 
 - Added `docs/CONTEXT.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/ASSUMPTIONS.md`, `docs/TODO.md`, `agents/IMPLEMENTATION.md` and `agents/MEMORY.md`, alongside the Phase 3 `docs/TECHSTACK.md`, `docs/CODEMAP.md` and `docs/DEPENDENCIES.md`. The human docs were left untouched.
